  (--add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway), TESTCONTAINERS_RYUK_DISABLED=true (local only; the nightly keeps Ryuk). The app server and its throwaway Postgres container come
  from playwright.config.ts's webServer (start-app-server.mjs). .env = env.example with generated AUTH/CRON/LIMIT_KEY secrets and a dummy Sentry DSN; never the repo's .env databases.
