    -e CI=1 -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock -v <repo copy>:/src:ro mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.63.0-noble sleep infinity; then docker exec: setup (copy /src to /work,
    Docker CLI, .env, install, prisma generate) and the runs below. The final runs used a fresh copy and a fresh install.
